          {
            "name_base": "Lijiang Old Town (Dayan Ancient Town)",
            "name_local": "丽江古城（大研古城）",
            "location_base": "Dayan Town, Lijiang City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市大研镇民主路与福慧路交叉口东南",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 26.870507,
              "lng": 100.235517
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "UNESCO World Heritage Site. Free entry to the old town itself (scenic area management fee of 80 CNY may be collected at key entry points). Evening stroll recommended: start at Sifang Square (四方街), walk along Water Street (水街), enjoy the lantern-lit canals. Avoid peak hours - evenings after 19:00 are quieter and more romantic. Wear comfortable walking shoes on cobblestones.",
            "notes_local": "世界文化遗产，古城内免票（部分入口收取80元景区管理费）。推荐晚上从四方街出发，沿水街漫步，欣赏灯光映水的夜景。19:00后人流减少，氛围更浪漫。注意石板路，穿舒适的鞋。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放（景区管理费收取时间 08:00-20:00）",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0378008PR",
                "display_text": "丽江古城 - 高德地图"
              },
