      {
        "day": 3,
        "date": "2026-06-22",
        "location": "Lijiang",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Jade Dragon Snow Mountain Scenic Area",
            "name_local": "玉龙雪山国家级风景名胜区",
            "location_base": "Tourism Ring Road, Yulong Naxi Autonomous County, Lijiang City",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市玉龙纳西族自治县旅游环线",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 27.098052,
              "lng": 100.258558
            },
            "cost": 105,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Natural Landmark",
            "type_local": "国家级自然风景区",
            "notes_base": "CRITICAL: Book tickets online in advance - cable car tickets sell out fast, especially in summer. Scenic area entrance: 105 CNY. Glacier Park cable car extra 160 CNY. Altitude 3,000-4,500m - bring warm layers even in June, bring altitude sickness medication. Depart by 07:00 to catch the 08:00 opening. Take the 101 special bus from Zhongyi Market (忠义市场). Recommended: Glacier Park (4680m viewpoint) OR Yunshu Ping (云杉坪) meadow - choose one. In June, snowpack may be thin at Glacier Park - check recent conditions on RedNote before going. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "重要：提前网上购票，缆车票夏季极易售罄。景区门票105元，冰川公园索道另付160元。海拔3000-4500米，6月仍需带厚外套，准备高反药。早上07:00前出发，从忠义市场乘101路专线。推荐选择冰川公园（4680网红打卡）或云杉坪草甸之一，不要贪多。6月冰川雪量可能偏少，出发前在小红书查看近况。",
            "opening_hours": "06:00-16:30",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0378008FA",
                "display_text": "玉龙雪山 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
                "type": "note",
                "url": "https://xhs.life-ai.app/explore/69db1fa3000000001b000ea8?xsec_token=AB7HVTopgPfWAwgoD7KClFhXNEvHemEss06RhT2Rhv10E=&xsec_source=pc_search",
                "display_text": "玉龙雪山+蓝月谷+牦牛坪攻略 - 小红书"
              }
            ],
            "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/8fde6fb2316745f771ad7e539f3bdba3"
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Blue Moon Valley (Yulong Snow Mountain)",
            "name_local": "蓝月谷",
            "location_base": "Inside Yulong Snow Mountain Scenic Area, Lijiang City",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市玉龙雪山国家级风景名胜区内",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 27.124436,
              "lng": 100.245886
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Natural Landmark",
            "type_local": "高原湖泊景区",
            "notes_base": "Included with the scenic area entrance ticket (105 CNY). Series of vivid turquoise lakes fed by snow melt from Jade Dragon Snow Mountain. RedNote users highlight Jade Liquid Lake (玉液湖) as the most photogenic spot - water glows blue-green, snow mountain reflected on the surface. Take the sightseeing electric cart within the valley (recommended - it is a long walk otherwise). Best visited in afternoon after morning at Glacier Park or Yunshu Ping. Allow 2-3 hours. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "包含在玉龙雪山景区门票内（105元）。雪山融水形成的翡翠色湖泊群，水质清澈发光。小红书用户强推玉液湖，随手拍都是壁纸级。建议乘坐景区内的观光电瓶车游览（步行时间太长）。上午玩冰川公园/云杉坪后，下午游蓝月谷，留2-3小时。",
            "opening_hours": "08:00-16:00",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0378157WA",
