                "url": "https://xhs.life-ai.app/explore/67698d08000000000800ce8e?xsec_token=ABWYPRObc9fpMhlN8Qi46eSJ7L8mxrBXS21Ml7oJqkO4c=&xsec_source=pc_search",
                "display_text": "束河古镇咖啡馆推荐 - 小红书"
