            "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/9196b3570203be7ec07ba065498c084a"
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Baisha Old Town",
            "name_local": "白沙古镇",
            "location_base": "Baisha Town, Yulong Naxi Autonomous County, Lijiang",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市玉龙纳西族自治县白沙镇",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 26.953303,
              "lng": 100.216933
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "纳西族古村落",
            "notes_base": "Optional afternoon add-on if energy allows. Smaller and more authentic than Shuhe - a traditional Naxi village with almost no tourist crowds. Notable spots: Yun Zhong Baisha Library (云中白沙书局) - a stunning design-forward library and cafe with rooftop views of Jade Dragon Snow Mountain; Pomegranate Courtyard Cafe (石榴院子咖啡酒馆) with rooftop terrace, 3-floors with unique decor. About 5km north of Shuhe - take a taxi. Perfect for INFJ who prefers non-touristy cultural depth. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "如果有体力，下午可顺道去。比束河更小、更原汁原味，几乎没有商业游客。必去：云中白沙书局（极具设计感的图书馆咖啡馆，屋顶可看雪山），石榴院子咖啡酒馆（三层屋顶观景台，超出片）。从束河打车约5公里，北边。INFJ喜欢的非商业化文化氛围。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
