      {
        "day": 5,
        "date": "2026-06-24",
        "location": "Dali",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Lijiang Old Town Morning Wander (Pre-Train)",
            "name_local": "丽江古城（晨游）",
            "location_base": "Dayan Town, Lijiang City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市大研镇",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 26.870507,
              "lng": 100.235517
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "Morning wander before taking the train to Dali. The old town is much quieter in the morning - most tourists have not woken up yet. Good time to grab a local Naxi breakfast near the market, walk the cobblestone lanes without crowds, and see daily life. Keep it short - need to head to train station by midday.",
            "notes_local": "坐火车去大理前，趁上午在古城转转。早上游客少，石板路清净，可以感受纳西族的日常生活。在集市附近吃个当地早餐。留意火车时间，中午前出发去火车站。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0378008PR",
                "display_text": "丽江古城 - 高德地图"
              }
            ],
            "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/79301b10705b92ec03da88565b18e0f5"
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Dali Old Town (Evening Arrival)",
            "name_local": "大理古城（傍晚抵达）",
            "location_base": "Huguo Road 172, Dali City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省大理白族自治州大理市护国路172号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.694836,
              "lng": 100.164
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "After arriving by train, do a gentle evening stroll of Dali Old Town. The city is dramatically set between Cangshan Mountain (苍山) and Erhai Lake (洱海). Explore Renmin Road (人民路) - the main street with artsy cafes and bookshops. The old town has a distinct Bai minority architecture style: white walls, grey tiles, painted eaves. Much more relaxed than Lijiang. Evening atmosphere is peaceful and romantic.",
            "notes_local": "坐火车抵达后，傍晚轻松游览大理古城。古城位于苍山和洱海之间，风光独特。逛人民路，有许多文艺咖啡馆和书店。大理古城的白族建筑（白墙灰瓦、彩绘飞檐）与丽江风格截然不同。氛围比丽江更放松、更浪漫。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0FFFZH0RQ",
                "display_text": "大理古城 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
