                "url": "https://xhs.life-ai.app/explore/699bd818000000002802189f?xsec_token=ABYTn7TuYdQa7ygHPOnc303d1Goq5WF-Mp1-h658rTdJ4=&xsec_source=pc_search",
                "display_text": "大理古城文艺City Walk - 小红书"
              }
            ],
            "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/6f58f6d8603c8ef98b2b0754c8d3c01a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "day": 6,
        "date": "2026-06-25",
        "location": "Dali",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Erhai Lake Ecological Corridor (West Shore Cycling Route)",
            "name_local": "洱海生态廊道（海西骑行路线）",
            "location_base": "West Shore of Erhai Lake, Dali City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省大理市洱海西岸环海西路",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.622667,
              "lng": 100.223557
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Scenic Area",
            "type_local": "湖滨生态廊道",
            "notes_base": "The west shore ecological corridor is the most scenic cycling route around Erhai Lake - about 50km of paved lakeside path with Cangshan Mountain on one side and the lake on the other. Rent bikes or e-bikes near the corridor entry. Key stops: Longkan Dock (龙龛码头) for sunrise and red pine trees, Panxi S-bend (磻溪S湾) for the iconic white bench and lake photo (morning light only - afternoon backlit), Langqiao Bridge (廊桥) for the arch-framed lake photo (popular with RedNote users). Start early (08:00) for best light and fewer crowds. West shore is car-free - pure cycling and walking. Rent e-bikes near Caicun or Dali Ancient Town. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "海西生态廊道是洱海最美的骑行路线，约50公里，左边苍山右边洱海。可在廊道入口附近租自行车或电动车。重点打卡：龙龛码头（红杉+湖面倒影，日出最美），磻溪S湾（白色长椅+S弯+洱海，上午光线最好，下午逆光），廊桥（桥洞框架构图，小红书热门机位）。早上08:00出发，光线最好人最少。海西廊道禁止机动车，可以骑行/步行。在才村或古城附近租电动车。",
            "opening_hours": "全天开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0G3JY36P7",
                "display_text": "洱海生态廊道 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
                "type": "note",
                "url": "https://xhs.life-ai.app/explore/69a4fdbe000000001600a133?xsec_token=ABFajV2jFIu9eipZrjnXX_aZPcZX9DmYpJaQW37sWw9t8=&xsec_source=pc_search",
                "display_text": "洱海徒步骑行攻略 - 小红书"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
                "type": "note",
                "url": "https://xhs.life-ai.app/explore/69dfbe3f000000001e00cf4d?xsec_token=ABu5ivUZzZxcz4L42iH8Akkj6a29QdpiO_6Eg2Gwtsr5A=&xsec_source=pc_search",
                "display_text": "大理西线骑行+龙龛磻溪喜洲攻略 - 小红书"
              }
            ],
            "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/53b8e1b78f54290fc5b7e8e6e6cf0344"
          },
          {
            "name_base": "Shuanglang Ancient Town",
            "name_local": "双廊古镇",
            "location_base": "S314 Huanhai East Road, Shuanglang Town, Dali City",
            "location_local": "云南省大理州双廊镇S314环海东路",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.908323,
              "lng": 100.194322
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "古镇景区",
            "notes_base": "Located on the east shore of Erhai Lake - offers the best sunset views looking west across the lake to Cangshan Mountain. Boutique guesthouses perched right over the water create an incredibly romantic lakeside atmosphere. The pebble beaches here are great for sitting and watching the sunset over the mountains. Note: east shore is ~30km drive from west shore, so plan accordingly - take a taxi after the morning west shore cycling. Many artsy cafes and boutique hotels with lake-view terraces. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "位于洱海东岸，是观看苍山日落倒影的最佳视角。精品民宿直接建在水边，洱海就在窗外，氛围极为浪漫。湖边鹅卵石滩适合坐着看日落。注意：东西岸距离约30公里，建议上午骑完西岸廊道后打车过来。文艺咖啡馆和观景台众多，是拍照出片的好地方。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B036814RT7",
                "display_text": "双廊古镇 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
