            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "REST DAY - pure relaxation. No schedule. Wander the quiet lanes of Dali Old Town at your own pace. Renmin Road (人民路) has excellent independent bookshops and small artsy galleries. Find a rooftop cafe with Cangshan Mountain views and sit for as long as you like. The old town is compact and walkable. Recommended: explore side streets off Renmin Road - more local, less tourist-facing. No need to see any specific sights today. Enjoy being present.",
            "notes_local": "纯休息日，不要做计划。随意逛大理古城。人民路有独立书店和文艺小店。找一家能看到苍山的屋顶咖啡馆，坐到你想走为止。古城不大，适合步行。推荐：从人民路拐进小巷，更有生活气息，不商业。今天不需要打卡任何景点，享受当下。",
