            "notes_base": "Optional afternoon lakeside stroll - no cycling needed today, just walk to the nearest lake access point from your accommodation. Sunset is especially beautiful from the west shore looking across to Cangshan Mountain, with golden light on the water. Perfect doing-nothing afternoon activity for a rest day. Sit by the water and enjoy the quiet.",
            "notes_local": "下午可选择轻松的湖边散步，不需要骑车，从住处步行至最近的洱海边即可。西岸傍晚可欣赏苍山倒影和金色余晖，是发呆的绝佳地点。适合休息日下午无所事事地贴贴，坐在湖边发呆。",
