            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "白族古镇",
            "notes_base": "Xizhou is a well-preserved Bai minority ancient town 18km north of Dali Old Town - less touristy and more authentic. Famous for grand Bai-style courtyard mansions. Highlights: stroll the Four Directions Square (四方街) lined with traditional architecture, explore Xilin Courtyard (喜林苑) - a beautifully restored heritage mansion that is one of Asia's top boutique hotels. The surrounding fields have seasonal crops and a small tourist railway. Allow 2-3 hours in the morning. RedNote tip: explore the small lanes behind the main square for authentic Bai village life. Take a taxi or bus from Dali Old Town (~30 min). Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "喜洲是大理以北18公里的白族古镇，比大理古城商业化程度低，保存完好的白族大院是核心看点。推荐：四方街（传统建筑围合），喜林苑（修缮精美的历史院落，亚洲顶级精品酒店之一）。附近有麦田/稻田（季节限定），还有小火车。上午游览2-3小时。小红书提示：深入主广场后面的小巷，体验真实的白族村落生活。从大理古城打车或坐公交约30分钟。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
